### Test Product Search API

# 1. Simple search
GET http://localhost:8080/product/search?searchTerm=phone&page=0&size=10

###

# 2. Search with category filter
GET http://localhost:8080/product/search?searchTerm=laptop&category=electronics&page=0&size=10

###

# 3. Price range search
GET http://localhost:8080/product/search?minPrice=100&maxPrice=1000&page=0&size=10

###

# 4. Advanced search via POST
POST http://localhost:8080/product/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchTerm": "phone",
  "category": "electronics",
  "minPrice": 200,
  "maxPrice": 800,
  "sortBy": "name",
  "sortDirection": "asc",
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20
}

###

# 5. Get product name suggestions
GET http://localhost:8080/product/suggestions/names?prefix=pho

###

# 6. Get category suggestions  
GET http://localhost:8080/product/suggestions/categories?prefix=ele

###

# 7. Get all products (no filters)
GET http://localhost:8080/product/getAllProducts?page=0&size=10